@startuml 08_seq_inscription_patient
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #EEF7FF
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #2E6DA4
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #2E6DA4
skinparam noteBorderColor #F0A500
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF8E1
title Séquence — Inscription patient & connexion JWT

actor "Patient" as P
participant "Application Flutter" as App
participant "API Gateway\n:8080" as GW
participant "auth-service\n:8081" as Auth
participant "user-service\n:8082" as UserSvc
database "psyconnect_auth" as DB_Auth
database "psyconnect_user" as DB_User

== Inscription ==

P -> App : Saisit e-mail, mot de passe,\nnom, prénom, pseudo
App -> GW : POST /auth/register/patient\n{email, password, firstName,\nlastName, pseudo}
GW -> Auth : route /auth/**
Auth -> DB_Auth : INSERT User{role=PATIENT,\nenabled=true, password=BCrypt}
DB_Auth --> Auth : User créé (id)
Auth --> GW : 200 OK {message: "Inscription réussie"}
GW --> App : 200 OK

App -> GW : POST /users\n{authUserId, firstName, lastName, phone}
GW -> UserSvc : route /users/**
UserSvc -> DB_User : INSERT UserProfile{authUserId}
DB_User --> UserSvc : UserProfile créé (id)
UserSvc --> GW : 201 Created {UserProfile}
GW --> App : 201 Created

App -> GW : POST /patients\n{authUserId, preferredLanguage,\nemergencyContact...}
GW -> UserSvc : route /patients/**
UserSvc -> DB_User : INSERT PatientProfile{walletBalance=0}
DB_User --> UserSvc : PatientProfile créé (id)
UserSvc --> GW : 201 Created {PatientProfile}
GW --> App : 201 Created
App -> P : ✓ Inscription réussie

== Connexion ==

P -> App : Saisit e-mail & mot de passe
App -> GW : POST /auth/login\n{email, password}
GW -> Auth : route /auth/**
Auth -> DB_Auth : SELECT User WHERE email=?
DB_Auth --> Auth : User{role, enabled, id}
Auth -> Auth : Vérifie BCrypt(password)
Auth -> Auth : Génère JWT\n{email, role=PATIENT, userId, exp=24h}
Auth --> GW : 200 OK {token, role, id, pseudo}
GW --> App : 200 OK
App -> App : Stocke le token JWT\nen mémoire (session)
App -> P : ✓ Connecté — accueil patient

note right of Auth
  Le JWT est auto-signé avec
  une clé secrète partagée par
  tous les services.
  Chaque service valide le token
  localement (JwtAuthenticationFilter).
end note

@enduml
